      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Waldron officially became a village in 1905, marking its formal recognition within Hillsdale County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waldron%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office opened on November 2, 1855, called South Wright because the community lay in the township’s southern part.",
