      "quality": "good",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "At the turn of the century, Waldron boasted its own band— the Waldron Citizens Band— complete with a band shell right in the middle of town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
